            "review_title": "Review at Chimac King",
            "review_text": "최승현\nHạ Long Bay, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nKorean seasoned chicken is so delicious.\nJun 2024 • Friends\nIt's a really cool place where you can eat Korean food while listening to the latest music.\nRestrooms are also separated for men and women. The entire restaurant is very clean and the serving staff are very friendly. The food is also very delicious.\nInsider tip:\nOpen from 4 PM to 12 PM. The fried seasoned chicken and tteokbokki gimbap are especially delicious.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 17, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
