            "review_text": "Trek43683077571\nVietnam3 contributions\n1\n\"Very clean and clean atmosphere and very delicious Korean chicken♡♡♡\nMay 2024 • Friends\n“A very delicious restaurant with Korean chicken, draft beer, and Korean soju.”\nI heard that there was a new Korean chicken in Ha Long and it was delicious, so I visited it. The food was really delicious, just like the rumors said, and most of all, the staff and the Korean owner were very kind and gave me explanations, so I had a great time~\nI guess I'll have to eat at least once tomorrow and go home~\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten May 18, 2024",
